sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Entry caller
    participant E as executor
    participant G as Entry / loss guards
    participant B as Existing MT5
    participant M as manager
    participant P as stop_legality
    S->>E: candidate intent
    E->>G: account / limits / durable loss / entry checks
    alt denied or missing evidence
        G-->>E: reject and preserve latch
    else allowed
        G-->>E: structured allow
        E->>B: guarded entry send
        B-->>E: actual result
    end
    Note over E,M: Entry hold is not permission to bypass stop legality
    M->>P: plan position stop with current evidence
    alt illegal / stale / widens stop
        P-->>M: reject with reason
    else legal and tighten-only
        P-->>M: allowed stop plan
        M->>B: modify SL/TP
        B-->>M: modification result
    end
